---
import BlogLayout from "../layouts/BlogLayout.astro";

const description =
  "Jonty Knox is an Australian software entrepreneur, Y Combinator alum and 0.1x engineer";
---

<BlogLayout
  title="Jonty Knox"
  description={description}
  activePath="/"
  subbarLeft="Founder · Engineer · Consultant"
  subbarRight="London, UK · Tuscany, IT · Adelaide, AU"
>
  <div class="home">
    <h1 class="visually-hidden">Jonty Knox</h1>
    <div class="home-hero">
      <img
        class="home-portrait"
        src="/images/jonty-knox-headshot-240.webp"
        alt="Jonty Knox"
        width="120"
        height="120"
        fetchpriority="high"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <h2 class="home-display">Australian software <span class="accent">entrepreneur</span></h2>
    </div>

    <section>
      <ul class="ledger-rows">
        <li>Working with founders on company building, AI/ML/Deep Learning, and growth</li>
        <li>Working on ethical solutions to the problems presented by AI</li>
                <li>
          Co-founded <a href="https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/customeros" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">CustomerOS (formerly Openline)</a>, backed by YC, Seedcamp, Crane and Cocoa
        </li>
        <li>
          Y Combinator alum
          (<a href="https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/customeros" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Summer 2022</a>)
        </li>
        <li>
          Previously Head of Product at Voxbone,
          <a
            href="https://www.bandwidth.com/blog/bandwidth-to-acquire-international-communications-leader-voxbone/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
          >
            sold to Bandwidth for US$519M in 2020
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          Previously ran Product at
          <a href="https://ottofinance.io" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"> Otto</a>,
          a Sequoia backed company
        </li>
        <li>Angel investor in 20+ pre-seed companies</li>
        <li>
          Based between
          <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/London,+UK/@51.5285262,-0.2664014,50065m" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">London, UK</a>,
          <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/53017+Radda+in+Chianti,+Province+of+Siena/@43.4864675,11.3315272,14597m/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Tuscany, Italy</a>, and
          <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Adelaide+SA,+Australia/@-35.0003214,138.2815278,131841m/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Adelaide, Australia</a>
        </li>
        <li><a href="mailto:jonty@jontyknox.com?subject=Sliding%20into%20your%20DMs">jonty@jontyknox.com</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="ledger-kicker">01 / Bio</h2>
      <p class="ledger-note">For event organizers, journalists, and podcast hosts to copy-paste.</p>
      <blockquote>
        <span>
          Jonty Knox is an Australian entrepreneur, engineer, and Y Combinator alum (Summer 2022). He co-founded CustomerOS, an AI company for enterprise sales and marketing teams. Today, he consults on company building, AI, computer vision, and marketing, while working on ethical solutions to the problems presented by AI. Previously, he was Head of Product at Voxbone, which was acquired by Bandwidth for $519M in 2020.
        </span>
      </blockquote>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="ledger-kicker">02 / Awards</h2>
      <ul class="ledger-rows">
        <li>
          <strong class="ledger-year">2023</strong>
          <a href="https://www.notion.vc/cloud-challengers-2023/top-100-b2b" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
            Notion VC's B2B Software 100 List
          </a>: #1 upcoming B2B SaaS company (Openline)
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="ledger-year">2021</strong>
          <a
            href="https://www.uctoday.com/unified-communications/introducing-your-uc-awards-2021-winners/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
          >
            UC Awards
          </a>: Most Innovative Product
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="ledger-year">2020</strong>
          <a
            href="https://www.ispreview.co.uk/index.php/2020/09/itspa-reveal-the-2020-best-uk-voip-provider-award-winners.html"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
          >
            ITSPA Awards
          </a>: Best VoIP Innovation
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="ledger-year">2019</strong>
          <a
            href="https://www.capacitymedia.com/article/29otbtelon5a9qh3hqfwg/news/the-winners-of-the-2019-global-carrier-awards-are-announced"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
          >
            Global Carrier Awards
          </a>: Best Voice Service Innovation - Mature Market
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="ledger-kicker">03 / Talks</h2>
      <p>
        Jonty has talked at prestigious locations globally as both a keynote speaker and panelist, at events in King's College, London and with Amazon's AWS.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="italy-project">
      <h2 class="ledger-kicker">04 / Interests</h2>
      <ul class="ledger-rows">
        <li>AI and machine learning, particularly in natural language processing and agent design</li>
        <li>Product strategy and go-to-market execution in B2B SaaS</li>
        <li>Enabling high-performance remote teams</li>
        <li>Running, cycling & playing music</li>
        <li>Currently restoring and renovating a 200+ year old farm house in Tuscany, Italy.</li>
        <li>Maintaining a few aging (modern) classic cars</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="ledger-kicker">05 / Media</h2>
      <div class="home-media">
        <figure>
          <img src="/images/jonty-knox-reflection-900.webp" alt="Jonty Knox headshot" width="900" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <figcaption>Introducing the world to CustomerOS AI Agents in 2024</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/images/jonty-knox-formal-900.webp" alt="Jonty Knox in traditional Scottish black tie" width="602" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <figcaption>Jonty in traditional Scottish black tie (kilt not pictured)</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/images/jonty-knox-office-900.webp" alt="Jonty Knox speaking about CustomerOS product strategy" width="900" height="675" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <figcaption>Speaking about CustomerOS's product strategy</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/images/jonty-knox-yc-retreat.webp" alt="Jonty Knox at YC S22 Batch Kickoff in Sonoma" width="400" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <figcaption>Attending the YC S22 Batch Kickoff in Sonoma, California</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/images/jonty-knox-westminster-900.webp" alt="Jonty Knox visiting Westminster" width="900" height="898" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <figcaption>Visiting Westminster to meet with the UK's Investment Minister</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="ledger-kicker">06 / Links</h2>
      <ul class="home-links">
        <li><a href="/blog">Blog</a></li>
        <li><a href="/tools">Tools</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://x.com/jontyknox" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Twitter/X</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jontyknox/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/jontyk" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Github</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.crunchbase.com/person/jonty-knox" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Crunchbase</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/customeros" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Y Combinator</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.producthunt.com/@jontyk" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">ProductHunt</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</BlogLayout>
